      "dcterms:title": "Coronavirus RNA specificity panel",
      "dcterms:description": "Panel consists of (cell-culture) RNA from different coronaviruses (HCoV-Nl63, HCoV-229E, HCoV-OC43, MERS-CoV and SARS-CoV) and is intended for use as control of specificity of molecular assays.\r\nThis panel contains sufficient RNA for t least 5 experiments.\r\n\"Disclaimer: Import permit may be needed in your country for SARS-CoV full virus RNA. If yes, please indicate so in your online enquiry\". Product for Alphacoronavirus and Betacoronavirus.\r\n ------------------\r\nNB: indicated price is only valid for non-profit laboratories. Commercial users will be contacted about pricing.",
      "EVORAO:unitDefinition": "100 uL",
      "EVORAO:category": {
        "@type": "EVORAO:ProductCategory",
        "dcterms:title": "nucleic acid"
