      "dcterms:description": "In vitro transcribed RNA for Wuhan coronavirus (2019-nCoV) real time (RT-)PCR targeting region of the E gene . \r\nProtocol and preliminary evaluation for this assays (Corman/Drosten 2020), as of Jan 13, 2020, available from:\r\nhttps://www.who.int/docs/default-source/coronaviruse/protocol-v2-1.pdf?sfvrsn=a9ef618c_2\r\n\r\nRef: https://www.eurosurveillance.org/content/10.2807/1560-7917.ES.2020.25.3.2000045",
