      "search:sku": "011A-02999",
      "search:title": "MERS-CoV single chain antibody HCAb-83",
      "search:description": "HCAb-83 is a MERS-CoV specific  camel/human chimeric heavy chain only antibody (HCAb) - composed of the camel VHH-83 linked to a human Fc domain lacking the CH1 exon Through direct cloning and expression of the variable heavy chains (VHHs) of HCAbs from the bone marrow of MERS-CoV infected dromedaries, MERS-CoV specific VHHs or nanobodies were produced. VHH-83 binds with exceptionally high affinity to the receptor binding domain of the viral spike protein. In vitro, HCAb-83 efficiently blocks virus entry at picomolar concentrations",
      "search:taxonLabel": "Middle East respiratory syndrome-related coronavirus",
      "search:publisherName": "European Virus Archive",
      "search:riskGroupLabel": "No RG",
      "search:collectionName": "ERASMUS-MC",
      "search:providerName": "ERASMUS-MC",
      "search:pathogenName": "MERS-CoV"
    },
