      "search:sku": "011V-02806",
      "search:title": "Human immunodeficiency virus 2 - RH2.3-3B3",
      "search:description": "This clone belongs to a unique set of HIV-2 biological clones from West African immigrants in The Netherlands. Clones were obtained from patients with non-progressive, aviremic or progressive, viremic HIV-2 infection. The HIV-2 biological clones were isolated after limiting dilution co-culture of patient PBMC or plasma with CD8-depleted PBMC from healthy blood bank donors. \r\nThe clone is replication competent and has been characterized for in vitro replication kinetics and co-receptor usage. Sequence is available in Genbank.",
      "search:taxonLabel": "Human immunodeficiency virus 2",
      "search:publisherName": "European Virus Archive",
      "search:riskGroupLabel": "RG3",
