      "dcterms:title": "Lyssavirus (Phylogroups 2 &amp; 3) RNA - PCR Quality Control Panel ",
      "dcterms:description": "A panel of 11 samples, including eight extracts from phylogroup 2 & 3 lyssaviruses, RABV and two NTC's (no tissue control). The panel can be anonymised so that the laboratory does not know which RNA comes from which virus. Results will be given to the requesting laboratory on request. The panel would be good for test development and assessing staff competence. RNA from the following viruses will be included: Rabies virus, Lleida Bat Lyssavirus, Ikoma virus, Shimoni Bat virus, Mokola virus and Lagos Bat Lyssaviruses a, b, c & d.",
      "EVORAO:unitDefinition": "20ul @ 1ug/ul per RNA sample",
