      "dcterms:title": "pHIV-1_delta-Env",
      "dcterms:description": "Plasmid containing an NL4-3 based HIV-1 genome with a big deletion between SalI site (5785) and XhoI site (8887), leading to a deletion of the viral genes vpu,env, tat, rev. Also the \"rev-response-element\" RRE is missing, leading to a lack of expression also of the gag-pol genes",
